      "content": "hey i need some help looking at something weird. my local water utility has been doing \"maintenance\" on my street every week for the past month but it's always at the same odd hours and they're digging way deeper than just pipes. i'm pretty sure they're installing sensors to monitor vibrations in the houses. can you help me look at their public work schedule to see if there's a pattern to when they're actually hitting specific houses?",
